OL,3,AMore than 150 flights cancelled on day
OL,4,Atwo of disruption as air traffic boss
OL,5,Afaces questions
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 150 flights have been
OL,8,Fcancelled today and others delayed
OL,9,Fbecause of knock-on effects from
OL,10,Fyesterday's technical problem at air
OL,11,Ftraffic control
OL,13,FSome 1,750 flights were cancelled on
OL,14,FTuesday, according to aviation
OL,15,Fanalytics firm Cirium, with hundreds of
OL,16,Fthousands of passengers thought to have
OL,17,Fbeen affected by the chaos
OL,19,FRyanair said on Tuesday that more than
OL,20,F65,000 of its customers had been
OL,21,Fdelayed by up to eight hours
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
