OL,3,AMore than 150 flights cancelled on day
OL,4,Atwo of disruption as air traffic boss
OL,5,Afaces questions
OL,6,
OL,7,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,8,Fblamed a technical glitch with its
OL,9,Fflight processing system - its boss
OL,10,FMartin Rolfe has apologised and says
OL,11,Fthere will be an investigation
OL,13,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander has
OL,14,Fsummoned Rolfe to a meeting - she's
OL,15,Fexpected to tell MPs that a cyber
OL,16,Fattack was "categorically" not the
OL,17,Fcause
